From 3fda0a9c3b5bad4e38af78a82385a04c142ae1c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 14:41:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 6/10] media: histb-vdec: add the V5R6 backend core and its
 H.264 path

The HiVDHV5R6C02 block of Hi3798MV200H takes a command image in DMA
memory instead of packed syntax registers, owns a memory-management unit
of its own and writes NV21 in 16-row bands. Add the plumbing that starts
a job and the H.264 command path, registered through the variant the
shared core already dispatches on. HEVC, MPEG-2 and MPEG-4 follow.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
