+ * initialisation process of ITU-T Rec. H.265 section 9.3.1.1 (m = 5 *
+ * slopeIdx - 45, n = 8 * offsetIdx - 16); the hardware derives the running
+ * (pStateIdx, valMps) from the slice QP itself. Two contexts pack into one word
+ * in little-endian byte order (m0, n0, m1, n1).
